Otherwise, make sure to call NODE_BINDING_EXTERNAL_REFERENCE() with an appropriate register method for the binding, and add it to EXTERNAL_REFERENCE_BINDING_LIST in src/node_external_reference.h

See "Registering binding functions used in bootstrap" in src/README.md for more details.
